// fixture-468: RFC rfc-trusted-index-invariant.md §4/S3 — the strict-success
// pin (round 2, breadth). index-trust "strict" + a verified-trusted bundle
// (MILPA_INDEX_TRUST_MOCK_VERIFIER=trusted, the file://-guarded conformance
// seam) mints a GatedIndex with VerificationResult::Trusted, and a named dep
// resolvable ONLY via the index is actually resolved out of it. Proves the
// type's raison d'etre: the gate RAN and PASSED, not merely that ungated
// access is blocked. Template: fixture-061-named-dep.
name "myapp"
kind "application"
index-trust "strict"
deps {
    bar ">= 2.0.0"
}
